{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_183","slug":"fr2023-183-une-annee-difficile","title":{"native":"Une année difficile","english":"A Difficult Year"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-10-18","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Olivier Nakache","slug":"olivier-nakache","name":"Olivier Nakache","birthYear":1973,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-174-hors-normes","title":{"native":"Hors normes"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]},{"id":"Éric Toledano","slug":"eric-toledano","name":"Éric Toledano","birthYear":1971,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-174-hors-normes","title":{"native":"Hors normes"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/206/17/266702/format_page/une-annee-difficile.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H3Syd1YsFoo"},"synopsis":{"native":"Albert et Bruno sont dans le rouge, consommateurs compulsifs, surendettés, ils vivotent entre petites combines pour l'un et une vie personnelle à la dérive pour l'autre. C’est dans le chemin associatif, qu’ils empruntent tous les deux pour sortir la tête de l’eau, qu’ils vont croiser des jeunes militants révoltés, alarmistes sur le climat, épris de justice sociale et d’éco-responsabilité. Plus attirés par la bière et les chips gratuites que par leurs arguments, Albert et Bruno vont peu à peu intégrer le mouvement sans conviction, si ce n’est celle de profiter de chaque action et de chaque rébellion pour magouiller et en tirer profit. Entre minimalisme idéologique ou subi, entre surconsommation et sobriété heureuse, nous faisons face à la simplicité complexe de notre avenir, aux oppositions et aux paradoxes de notre époque, bref tout va bien…","english":"When Albert and Bruno, both compulsive spenders and in debt up to their necks, turn to community workers to get a grip on their lives, they run into a group of young green activists. Lured by the free beer and crisps rather than by the ideals of these eco-activists, Albert and Bruno find themselves joining the movement without much conviction."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Christiane Bopp","slug":"christiane-bopp","name":"Christiane Bopp","birthYear":1964,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Danièle Lebrun","slug":"daniele-lebrun","name":"Danièle Lebrun","birthYear":1937,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Mathieu Amalric","slug":"mathieu-amalric","name":"Mathieu Amalric","birthYear":1965,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-126-barbara","title":{"native":"Barbara"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Michel Winogradoff","slug":"michel-winogradoff","name":"Michel Winogradoff","birthYear":1955,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Olivier Nakache","slug":"olivier-nakache","name":"Olivier Nakache","birthYear":1973,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-174-hors-normes","title":{